IMPORTANT NOTES ABOUT DOWNLOADED DATA:

1. PMC Open Access Papers:
   - Each downloaded paper includes its own license information
   - License details are stored in the metadata JSON files
   - Most papers use Creative Commons licenses (CC-BY, CC-BY-NC, etc.)
   - Users must respect individual paper licenses

2. PubMed Abstracts:
   - PubMed abstracts are in the PUBLIC DOMAIN
   - No copyright restrictions apply
   - Can be freely used for any purpose (commercial or non-commercial)
   - Reference: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/home/about/policies/

3. User Responsibilities:
   - Comply with NCBI usage policies
   - Respect individual paper licenses from PMC
   - Provide proper attribution in academic publications
   - Use data ethically and responsibly
